      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's good. Can you make it even stronger? I really want to emphasize that the managed conservation crowd is basically just trying to keep nature on a leash for their own benefit, and that their methods are actually causing more harm than good in the long run. Can you bake that critique into the text?",
